Intended direction (non-binding statement — NOT the final license terms)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The author intends to release RustScreen under a license that is as compatible with
Voluntaryism as possible. The expected shape of those terms:

  - Similar in spirit to the GNU GPL, BUT WITHOUT mandatory disclosure of source
    code. You may distribute a binary without publishing its source.

  - You may not prevent other people from copying, inspecting, and modifying the
    BINARY — unless they have agreed not to do so in a written, private contract.

  - Modification, redistribution, and commercial use are permitted.

This section describes intent only and confers no rights. It will be replaced by the
binding license text once finalized.
